Package: subssl
Version: 2.2.3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-aiohttp, python3-dnspython, python3-cryptography
Maintainer: subssl maintainers
Description: NIC.RU DNS-zone based TLS certificate inventory
 Scans enabled hostnames from a NIC.RU DNS zone, writes JSON/CSV reports,
 and can publish TLS certificate metrics to a Prometheus Pushgateway.
